# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Multiply as lighting: white leaves the base alone, black kills it, grey
# shades it. A warm colour layer in `multiply` tints the kaleidoscope, and a
# greyscale sprite stretched over the whole 64x64 panel darkens the corners.
S - Vignette & Tint
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Kaleidoscope
I @pat/kaleidoscope-2d
L color 0 0 0 0 multiply 100 none fill 1
N Tint
K ffc890
L sprite 0 0 64 64 multiply 100 none fill 1
N Vignette
I @spr/vignette
